abstract: "Native Linux desktop application (x86_64) for quantum error correction research and evaluation, built on the qector-decoder-v3 0.7.0 Rust/Python backend. Provides 16 decoder algorithms, 10 code families (including qLDPC and color codes), a full GUI, command-line interface, and a 56-tool Model Context Protocol (MCP) server. Distributed as a portable AppImage or as distro-tuned Debian packages, fully offline after first launch."
keywords:
